<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Transportadora started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Transportadora started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell started coverage of Transportadora de Gas del Sur SA with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1/8 to 11-7/8.  </p>
<p>-- Analysts Thomas Gray and Carlos de Leon said the company has a tight control on costs, an attractive dividend yield, and a solid balance sheet. They gave the stock a 12 month price target of $14.</p>
</text>
